  "idea": "Airtable vs Google Sheets: when do you actually need a relational database",
  "text": "Stop using Google Sheets for tasks that require file attachments and linked records. Pasting Google Drive links into spreadsheet cells creates permission errors and stalls creative production. Flat spreadsheets cannot display visual previews or handle multi-stage approvals without broken third-party add-ons. Airtable handles rich file attachments natively inside Kanban boards with automated stage status notifications. This accelerates asset delivery without confusion.",
